  "Description": {
    "DefaultText": "Lowered by wounds and increased through dressings. The lower your skin integrity the easier it is for you to catch infections when dirty.",
    "Text": "因伤口而降低，因包扎而增加。你的皮肤完整性越低，脏的时候就越容易感染。",
    "zh": "因伤口而降低，因包扎而增加。你的皮肤完整性越低，脏的时候就越容易感染。",
    "en": "Lowered by wounds and increased through dressings. The lower your skin integrity the easier it is for you to catch infections when dirty.",
    "ja": "怪我で弱まり、包帯で強くなる。弱ければ弱いほど汚れた時に感染しやすい。"
  },
